      "note": "Five of the six entries are assumed and NEED CURATION. The weights set which compartment dominates a whole-cell average, so they change the physical reading of the prediction; they do not limit what the model can fit, because each compartment's concentration is free inside the window and can compensate for a wrong weight. The fractions sum to 1 over the intracellular compartments, and a compartment where the GEM has no species for an amino acid contributes nothing to that amino acid's average."
